<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-TOUR OF ROMANDIE FOURTH STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF ROMANDIE FOURTH STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>VEYSONNAZ, Switzerland 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in</p>
